    <string name="c_privacy_text">Contactos has no ads or analytics. It shows and edits the contacts your phone already has, in the account where they are (Google, SIM or phone); the app keeps no copies of its own. Inicio only sees names and birthday days, never numbers. Only if you turn on MCP mode, the AI you connect with a token can search and read your contacts and, with a read-and-write token, create contacts and mark favourites, through the relay. The AI never deletes contacts nor calls or writes.</string>
